aerographene: rodape da sidebar vertical fixo na base.

O TabStripView tinha max kPreferred, entao o FlexLayout do
VerticalTabStripRegionView deixava o VerticalTabStripFooter logo apos as abas.
Com kUnbounded o TabStripView recebe a altura restante (o scroll interno segue
valendo quando ha muitas abas) e o rodape fica na base. Sem view nem layout
extra. Depende de aerographene/sidebar-footer.patch (aplica depois dele e do
perf-startup-layout.patch).

--- a/chrome/browser/ui/views/frame/vertical_tab_strip_region_view.cc	2026-10-11 14:23:34.809311376 -0300
+++ b/chrome/browser/ui/views/frame/vertical_tab_strip_region_view.cc	2026-10-11 14:23:40.899949952 -0300
@@ -687,10 +687,12 @@
 }
 
 void VerticalTabStripRegionView::OnTabStripViewSet() {
+  // aerographene: o TabStripView ocupa o espaco restante (kUnbounded) e empurra o
+  // rodape para a base da sidebar; sem isso o rodape fica logo apos as abas.
   tab_strip_view()->SetProperty(
       views::kFlexBehaviorKey,
       views::FlexSpecification(views::MinimumFlexSizeRule::kScaleToMinimum,
-                               views::MaximumFlexSizeRule::kPreferred));
+                               views::MaximumFlexSizeRule::kUnbounded));
   tab_strip_view()->SetProperty(views::kMarginsKey,
                                gfx::Insets::TLBR(0, 0, kBottomContainerGap, 0));
 
